{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>כשך</b> — the name of a verb from the doubled-root verbs." "<b>He remembered Vashti.</b> In speech. And perhaps he remembered her beauty; therefore the vav [in] ואת אשר עשתה ('and what she had done')." "<b>נגזר [was decreed].</b> From cutting among cuts [i.e., from the root גזר]."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:30:06.344871826Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}